 ],
 "synopsis": "Dalmia Bharat Refractories divested an 11.11% stake in RHI Magnesita India through a block deal worth Rs 826 crore. The seller offloaded 2,29,41,224 shares at a price of Rs 360 apiece on the NSE. The buyers comprised four institutional investors: SBI Mutual Fund, which acquired the bulk of the shares representing roughly 8.07% of the equity, alongside Bandhan Mutual Fund, Nippon India Mutual Fund, and Clarus Capital 1. Following the transaction, RHI Magnesita shares finished trading at Rs 379.20.",
